{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22170","headline":"观稼 · 白居易","name":"观稼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世役不我牵，身心常自若。\n晚出看田亩，闲行旁村落。\n累累绕场稼，啧啧羣飞雀。\n年丰岂独人，禽鸟声亦乐。\n田翁逢我喜，默起具尊杓。\n敛手笑相延，社酒有残酌。\n媿兹勤且敬，藜杖爲淹泊。\n言动任天真，未觉农人恶。\n停杯问生事，夫种妻儿获。\n筋力苦疲劳，衣食常单薄。\n自慙禄仕者，曾不营农作。\n饱食无所劳，何殊卫人鹤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22170.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22170","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}